---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Acupressure Points & Natural Healing Guide" description="Learn acupressure through traditional wisdom and modern science. Explore our interactive body atlas to discover pressure points, their locations, and how to use them." websiteSchema={true}>
<section class="relative overflow-hidden min-h-[420px] lg:aspect-[12/5] bg-emerald-800 flex items-center"><img src="/images/hero-body.png" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-800/90 from-0% via-emerald-800/40 via-50% to-emerald-800/20 to-80%"></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6 w-full"><div class="max-w-[520px] py-16 md:py-20"><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">Learn Acupressure<br><span class="text-copper">Through Traditional Wisdom<br>& Modern Science</span></h1><p class="mt-4 text-base text-emerald-100/80 leading-relaxed max-w-md">Explore acupressure points, learn how they work, and discover practical self-care techniques grounded in both ancient tradition and clinical research.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/atlas" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-copper px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-all hover:bg-copper/90 active:scale-[0.98]">Explore Points</a><a href="/learn" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-white/25 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-all hover:bg-white/10 active:scale-[0.98]">Learning Center</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 lg:px-6"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Where would you like to start?</h2><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><a href="/history" class="group rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(45,106,79,0.08)] dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">History</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">How acupressure evolved from ancient China to modern clinical practice.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">Explore ›</span></a><a href="/atlas" class="group rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(45,106,79,0.08)] dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Points Atlas</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Explore acupressure points through an interactive body map.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">Explore ›</span></a><a href="/learn" class="group rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(45,106,79,0.08)] dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Learning Center</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Fundamentals, safety, techniques, and the science behind the practice.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">Explore ›</span></a><a href="/about" class="group rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(45,106,79,0.08)] dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">About</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Our mission, our approach, and the team behind this knowledge platform.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">Explore ›</span></a></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-emerald-50/60 dark:bg-emerald-900/10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 lg:px-6"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Explore the Body</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Click a body region to discover its acupressure points.</p><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-6 gap-4"><a href="/body/head-acupressure-points" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200/60 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(45,106,79,0.06)] dark:border-emerald-800 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 group"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 140" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-16 h-16"><ellipse cx="60" cy="55" rx="38" ry="45" fill="rgba(45,106,79,0.06)" stroke="#2d6a4f" stroke-width="1.5"></ellipse><ellipse cx="60" cy="45" rx="22" ry="16" fill="rgba(45,106,79,0.04)" stroke="#2d6a4f" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.5"></ellipse><circle cx="60" cy="40" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="60" cy="65" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="55" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="78" cy="55" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="60" cy="80" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><text x="60" y="120" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#2d6a4f" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">Head</text></svg><span class="text-xs font-medium text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-center leading-tight group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Head</span></a><a href="/body/face-acupressure-points" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200/60 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald